The workflows folder contains automated CI/CD pipelines that define how code changes are tested and deployed. It houses the ci-test-coverage.yml file which automates test execution and coverage reporting for pull requests and pushes to specific branches, and cut-release.yml which tags and cuts a per-environment GitHub Release whenever a PR merges into one of the three release/* branches. These workflows integrate with the project's version control system to ensure code quality and automate the software delivery process.
